# Anje's Ravager is cast on turn 5; on turn 7 it attacks with no Attack line at all - the default declares no attackers,
# so only "attacks each combat if able" sends it in - and "discard your hand, then draw
# three cards" discards the second Ravager from Bot1's hand. Madness (CR 702.35a) exiles it instead of putting it into the
# graveyard, and its linked ability lets Bot1 cast it for {1}{R}. The discarded Mountains go to the graveyard as usual,
# the draw of three still happens, and the twin ends on the battlefield.

